    "content": "averageUnitPrice is an unweighted arithmetic mean of the per-line unit prices and ignores quantity entirely. Verified by executing the compiled code: cartTotal([{unitPrice:100,quantity:1},{unitPrice:1,quantity:100}]) returns averageUnitPrice 50.5, while the actual price paid per unit is subtotal/itemCount = 200/101 ≈ 1.98. In a cart-totaling context 'average unit price' most naturally means price paid per unit; the simple mean is misleading whenever quantities differ across lines. If the unweighted mean is intentional, it should be documented on the CartTotal interface.",
