    "evidence": "Compiled all three files with tsc and executed: mixed-cart case returned {\"itemCount\":101,\"subtotal\":200,\"averageUnitPrice\":50.5}; weighted average is ~1.98. Empty-cart case correctly returned averageUnitPrice 0 (mean's RangeError is guarded)."
